<title>AUSTRALIA: AWB makes final payments on 1995/96 wheat pool.</title>
<headline>AWB makes final payments on 1995/96 wheat pool.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said it will pay more than A$4 million to Australian farmers this week in final payments on the 1995/96 domestic pools.</p>
<p>The final payments were for deliveries of canola, pulses, sorghum, lupins, oats and triticale as well as wheat.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
